{"5119140":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Midnight Rogues","steam_appid":5119140,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/bc422f8e9f395b4aef45e6cb7c75f89b.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midnight Rogues is a roguelike auto-battler where you buy and arrange cards across a timed tableau and build the sequence that fights for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once combat begins, a countdown moves through your tableau  and activates everything in its path. Place the right card in the right slot, order your effects carefully, and build a combo that vanquishes enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/58d362e1c701f4174df79bfc61eec700.poster.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/58d362e1c701f4174df79bfc61eec700.webm?t=1793727723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/58d362e1c701f4174df79bfc61eec700.mp4?t=1793727723\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/8c0f7093c4a6923027c96a2299a99faa.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short and satisfying loop<\/strong> of finding new items, arranging your tableau, and fighting enemies in an auto-battler format.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment with 3 characters and over 190 unique items<\/strong> to discover new builds, interactions, and combinations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect over 35 unique relics<\/strong> and use their effects to shape your strategy throughout each run.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight through 4 acts and face 10 unique boss passives<\/strong>, each with its own way to torment you.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on 10 difficulty modifiers<\/strong> and push your builds further as the challenge keeps increasing.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/c6add22f12faca6802aabdeea5d291ee.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy powerful weapons and strange items, rearrange them on your tableau, and experiment with their order to maximize their effects.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you place a card determines how it interacts with everything around it, what activates first, and how the rest of your build unfolds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exact same collection of cards can produce completely different results depending on how you arrange it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/f980c13f0a0dfdbfe685546e091cd9ad.poster.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/f980c13f0a0dfdbfe685546e091cd9ad.webm?t=1793727723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/f980c13f0a0dfdbfe685546e091cd9ad.mp4?t=1793727723\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/969dfcc6b27f80e25129e45d96f80302.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger throughout each run. Spend your earnings at the shop to buy better cards, and defeat bosses to gain relics that can give you tremendous power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strongest cards aren’t always the ones with the biggest numbers. Choose cards that work together, then arrange them so every activation counts. Slow the countdown to squeeze more value from an attack, stack poison before multiplying it, or reverse the timer to trigger your earlier cards again.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/163b5b9b4845db31d1f67975da074b37.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The City belongs to its superheroes, and organized crime is how they keep it that way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three young couriers were sent to deliver a package to a research lab. Little did they know that they were carrying a bomb!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They survive the explosion with newfound powers, only to be framed for the disaster by the heroes who sent them. With the mysterious Master Wizard’s help, the Midnight Rogues set out to take revenge on the people who used them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every hero they bring down leaves The City a little closer to collapse.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/bc422f8e9f395b4aef45e6cb7c75f89b.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midnight Rogues is a roguelike auto-battler where you buy and arrange cards across a timed tableau and build the sequence that fights for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once combat begins, a countdown moves through your tableau  and activates everything in its path. Place the right card in the right slot, order your effects carefully, and build a combo that vanquishes enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/58d362e1c701f4174df79bfc61eec700.poster.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/58d362e1c701f4174df79bfc61eec700.webm?t=1793727723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/58d362e1c701f4174df79bfc61eec700.mp4?t=1793727723\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/8c0f7093c4a6923027c96a2299a99faa.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short and satisfying loop<\/strong> of finding new items, arranging your tableau, and fighting enemies in an auto-battler format.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment with 3 characters and over 190 unique items<\/strong> to discover new builds, interactions, and combinations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect over 35 unique relics<\/strong> and use their effects to shape your strategy throughout each run.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight through 4 acts and face 10 unique boss passives<\/strong>, each with its own way to torment you.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on 10 difficulty modifiers<\/strong> and push your builds further as the challenge keeps increasing.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/c6add22f12faca6802aabdeea5d291ee.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy powerful weapons and strange items, rearrange them on your tableau, and experiment with their order to maximize their effects.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you place a card determines how it interacts with everything around it, what activates first, and how the rest of your build unfolds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exact same collection of cards can produce completely different results depending on how you arrange it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/f980c13f0a0dfdbfe685546e091cd9ad.poster.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/f980c13f0a0dfdbfe685546e091cd9ad.webm?t=1793727723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/f980c13f0a0dfdbfe685546e091cd9ad.mp4?t=1793727723\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/969dfcc6b27f80e25129e45d96f80302.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger throughout each run. Spend your earnings at the shop to buy better cards, and defeat bosses to gain relics that can give you tremendous power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strongest cards aren’t always the ones with the biggest numbers. Choose cards that work together, then arrange them so every activation counts. Slow the countdown to squeeze more value from an attack, stack poison before multiplying it, or reverse the timer to trigger your earlier cards again.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/extras\/163b5b9b4845db31d1f67975da074b37.avif?t=1793727723\" width=1170 height=120 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The City belongs to its superheroes, and organized crime is how they keep it that way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three young couriers were sent to deliver a package to a research lab. Little did they know that they were carrying a bomb!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They survive the explosion with newfound powers, only to be framed for the disaster by the heroes who sent them. With the mysterious Master Wizard’s help, the Midnight Rogues set out to take revenge on the people who used them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every hero they bring down leaves The City a little closer to collapse.<\/p>","short_description":"Build the sequence that fights for you in this roguelike auto-battler. Buy cards and arrange them across your board, then watch a timer activate them in order. Change their placement to create powerful combinations and take down The City’s corrupted superheroes.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/7cc319a56468c2062ca36a261fc253cc92a13a92\/header.jpg?t=1793727723","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/62d8f15ff1bde239ecd6c3e04c3aee2ad8f03089\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793727723","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/62d8f15ff1bde239ecd6c3e04c3aee2ad8f03089\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793727723","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 \/ AMD Radeon R9 380<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 580 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1080p, Low settings<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit or better<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© 2026 Aduran Studio. All rights reserved.<br \/>\r\nSelected icons from Game-icons.net, created by various contributors and licensed under CC BY 3.0. Modified for use in Midnight Rogues. Complete asset titles, creator names, and source links are available in the in-game Credits.","developers":["Aduran Studio"],"publishers":["Aduran Studio","Permanent Way Entertainment"],"demos":[{"appid":5214840,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":719,"final":575,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"7,19€","final_formatted":"5,75€"},"packages":[1773082],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Midnight Rogues","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1773082,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Midnight Rogues - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">7,19€<\/span> 5,75€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":575}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/79e6c323e49b1231941eac0e2f491f232e0b25f7\/ss_79e6c323e49b1231941eac0e2f491f232e0b25f7.600x338.jpg?t=1793727723","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/79e6c323e49b1231941eac0e2f491f232e0b25f7\/ss_79e6c323e49b1231941eac0e2f491f232e0b25f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793727723"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/5c0906cd77cc93b6890add98c03f46b95fe830aa\/ss_5c0906cd77cc93b6890add98c03f46b95fe830aa.600x338.jpg?t=1793727723","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/5c0906cd77cc93b6890add98c03f46b95fe830aa\/ss_5c0906cd77cc93b6890add98c03f46b95fe830aa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793727723"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/2e579edaa0589d603edddc2a47618fb75b81922b\/ss_2e579edaa0589d603edddc2a47618fb75b81922b.600x338.jpg?t=1793727723","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/2e579edaa0589d603edddc2a47618fb75b81922b\/ss_2e579edaa0589d603edddc2a47618fb75b81922b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793727723"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/5605037634f6bbdf443f63e23be85663158967de\/ss_5605037634f6bbdf443f63e23be85663158967de.600x338.jpg?t=1793727723","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/5605037634f6bbdf443f63e23be85663158967de\/ss_5605037634f6bbdf443f63e23be85663158967de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793727723"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/b07b2f1eac3fd814e280d87d68c593d5bfbe3721\/ss_b07b2f1eac3fd814e280d87d68c593d5bfbe3721.600x338.jpg?t=1793727723","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/b07b2f1eac3fd814e280d87d68c593d5bfbe3721\/ss_b07b2f1eac3fd814e280d87d68c593d5bfbe3721.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793727723"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/4b200b04b16c5e91f4ce77e08f685e9c096bcae9\/ss_4b200b04b16c5e91f4ce77e08f685e9c096bcae9.600x338.jpg?t=1793727723","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5119140\/4b200b04b16c5e91f4ce77e08f685e9c096bcae9\/ss_4b200b04b16c5e91f4ce77e08f685e9c096